@startuml
title app Query Builder状態図
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #455A64

[*] --> Empty

Empty --> Dirty : set / addEntity / where / join
Dirty --> Built : build成功\nquery設定後isBuild=true
Dirty --> Invalid : 必須指定不足
Invalid --> Dirty : 必須指定を追加

Built --> Built : build()\nキャッシュ済みquery返却
Built --> Dirty : SQLへ影響する操作\nisBuild=false

state "Update/Delete対象範囲" as Scope {
  [*] --> Conditional
  Conditional --> AllRecords : updateAll / deleteAll
  AllRecords --> Conditional : where
}

note right of Scope
whereと全件指定は、
後から呼び出した方を有効とする。
end note

@enduml
